<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tom Brown raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Salomon Brothers said it raised its rating on Tom Brown Inc to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- said merger with Presidio Oil, which closed December 23, will provide Tom Brown with increased cash flow and additional drilling opportunities.</p>
<p>-- said Tom Brown has exploration opportunities that &quot;easily surpass&quot; those of many of its peers.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month target price of $26 a share.</p>
<p>-- Tom Brown gained 7/16 to 23-5/8 in morning trading.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk 212 859-1730))</p>
</text>
